      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "炼丹展示",
      "text": "炼丹炉需要炉体、炉盖、丹火与已安装丹方。炉体/炉盖/丹火分为一至五阶，部分高阶丹药还要求控火境界或完整地火室。地火室以宗门地火室阵基为中心，下方放置岩浆块，东西南北四侧各放置一个聚灵阵；丹炉需在阵基 5 格水平、2 格垂直范围内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "内置丹方",
      "text": "当前内置 22 个炼丹 JSON：cultivation_pill、qi_recovery_pill、calming_pill_low、foundation_building_pill_low、spirit_gathering_pill、fire_origin_pill、ice_fire_pill、marrow_cleansing_pill、body_tempering_pill、fasting_pill_low、essence_condensing_pill、soul_gathering_pill、marrow_repair_pill、clear_void_pill、forget_dust_pill、appearance_fixing_pill、longevity_pill、blood_qi_pill、return_yang_true_water、marrow_extracting_pill、soul_breaking_pill、poison_dragon_pearl。"
    }
  ]
